File name: SDSPLOP2.MP
Path description: Small Pyramid (harder loop)
Path starts: Small Pyramid, Entrance
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 6 
Level recommendation: 35-45
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: stronghold guard, undead monsters (unsure of names).
Additional information:

To get to the start of this loop you need a waterskin (bought from the
general store in Khazarad or Silvermere for 5g), and you need to have
completed the Module 6 quest up to where you get the guard sergeant to
'blood' you.
To run this loop, you need to have completed the Module 6 up to the
stage where you give the withered old man a tankard of ale.
For this loop, you need to do the following things. Go to
Game Data -> Monsters, and set stronghold guards as Enemy, Non-hostile
and Low priority. 
This loop ventures a small way into the undead area below the small
pyramid, and is recommended for higher level people only.
It is *highly* recommended you do not attack the gaurd sergeant, because
stronghold guards protect him, and they have a nasty habit of regenning
without a 'stronghold guard moves into the room from the blah' message,
which means all the stronghold guards beat down on your when you try
and attack the guard sergeant.

Included in this zip is SDSPDVVS.MP and DVOTSDSP.MP which are direct paths
to and from the start of this loop.
